# The build context is the repository root, so this file (named after the Dockerfile) is
# the one the build reads. Send only what the Dockerfile copies. A locally installed
# node_modules or a local dist must never reach the image: the build installs its own
# from the lock file, and a stale local copy would silently replace them.
**
!workers/video-gpu/**
!lib/**
**/node_modules
workers/video-gpu/dist
